doc:
**Rayleigh bounds.** For Hermitian `A` whose eigenvalues all lie in `[a, c]`,
`a ‖x‖² ≤ re (xᴴ A x) ≤ c ‖x‖²` with `‖x‖² = re (xᴴ x)`. Horn–Johnson 2013, Thm 4.2.2;
Parlett 1998, §1.4.

